    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s post office has called the Reever/Renner building home since the mid‑1800s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.emmitsburg.net/archive_list/articles/history/stories/history_of_news_midway.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Jesse Renner, a local entrepreneur, built the first airplane in Frederick County and later flew it from a makeshift runway on his Renner farm.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.emmitsburg.net/archive_list/articles/history/stories/history_of_news_midway.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Renner general store, founded around 1910, became a community hub for nearly a century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.emmitsburg.net/archive_list/articles/history/stories/history_of_news_midway.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "New Midway sits just north of Woodsboro, a short drive away, and has been a quiet hamlet for over a century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.emmitsburg.net/archive_list/articles/history/stories/history_of_news_midway.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Reever family has owned a woodshop/workshop in the town’s garage since the 1990s, continuing a tradition of local craftsmanship.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
